Synth preset dropdown closes immediately after opening.

Switched from nk_combo_begin_label to nk_combobox API. If still broken,
investigate whether Nuklear popup state is being reset by something
(focus steal, window clear, etc).

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Preset dropdown stays open when clicked
- [ ] Can scroll through and select any of 50 presets
- [ ] Mode dropdown also stays open and is selectable
- [ ] Works after window resize

## Test Plan
- [ ] Click preset dropdown, verify it stays open
- [ ] Select different preset, verify synth parameters update
- [ ] Click mode dropdown, verify it works
